1
00:00:40,520 --> 00:00:41,050
Ling Hao,

2
00:00:41,360 --> 00:00:42,120
come down!

3
00:00:49,320 --> 00:00:50,320
I've thought a lot

4
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,970
these past two days.

5
00:00:54,720 --> 00:00:55,320
I can understand

6
00:00:55,320 --> 00:00:56,960
why everyone hates me.

7
00:00:57,920 --> 00:00:58,720
I've actually

8
00:00:58,880 --> 00:00:59,960
been pretending

9
00:01:00,400 --> 00:01:02,060
not to care about being hated.

10
00:01:02,920 --> 00:01:04,250
I pretended to enjoy it.

11
00:01:07,360 --> 00:01:08,320
In reality, I was just

12
00:01:08,320 --> 00:01:09,250
lying to myself.

13
00:01:15,120 --> 00:01:15,320
I want to say something.

14
00:01:15,320 --> 00:01:16,650
I want to say something.

15
00:01:18,520 --> 00:01:21,380
I'm willing to cooperate
with your investigation.

16
00:01:22,160 --> 00:01:23,120
I beg you

17
00:01:24,280 --> 00:01:25,400
to clear my name.

18
00:01:25,920 --> 00:01:27,780
We now have surveillance footage

19
00:01:27,960 --> 00:01:29,490
proving that Luan Pingping

20
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,690
got into your car on her own that night.

21
00:01:32,960 --> 00:01:34,039
You mean...

22
00:01:38,320 --> 00:01:38,920
What is it?

23
00:01:40,680 --> 00:01:41,210
Nothing.

24
00:01:43,840 --> 00:01:44,700
I just feel that

25
00:01:45,720 --> 00:01:46,960
when I go home,

26
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:49,200
my neighbors might

27
00:01:49,200 --> 00:01:50,680
ostracize me even more.

28
00:01:51,560 --> 00:01:53,680
After all, a child died in my car.

29
00:01:54,320 --> 00:01:55,479
I wasn't sentenced

30
00:01:56,240 --> 00:01:57,240
and got released.

31
00:01:58,840 --> 00:02:00,570
That's not what they expected.

32
00:02:00,720 --> 00:02:02,250
Since we're on the subject,

33
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:02,920
Ling Wei,

34
00:02:03,840 --> 00:02:04,720
this hostility

35
00:02:04,720 --> 00:02:06,120
they have towards you...

36
00:02:07,960 --> 00:02:11,420
It probably started the year
my brother died in that accident.

37
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:16,500
You cared about him a lot, didn't you?

38
00:02:16,680 --> 00:02:17,940
I cared about him a lot.

39
00:02:18,720 --> 00:02:19,380
I loved him.

40
00:02:21,320 --> 00:02:22,980
So someone started a rumor...

41
00:02:23,520 --> 00:02:24,450
I killed Haohao.

42
00:02:26,120 --> 00:02:27,250
I couldn't stand it.

43
00:02:28,160 --> 00:02:29,760
If you care about him so much,

44
00:02:30,320 --> 00:02:31,480
why did you hit him?

45
00:02:32,920 --> 00:02:33,640
Haohao!

46
00:02:35,640 --> 00:02:36,280
Haohao!

47
00:02:39,760 --> 00:02:40,240
Haohao!

48
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:44,170
Where did you go?

49
00:02:44,560 --> 00:02:46,160
Do you know how worried I was?

50
00:02:47,040 --> 00:02:47,800
Sister,

51
00:02:47,960 --> 00:02:49,640
the older kids in the neighborhood

52
00:02:49,640 --> 00:02:51,160
bullied me.

53
00:02:51,720 --> 00:02:53,640
They said I have no dad

54
00:02:53,880 --> 00:02:55,160
or mom,

55
00:02:55,320 --> 00:02:59,160
and that I was picked up from a trash can.

56
00:03:00,880 --> 00:03:02,080
Did they hit you?

57
00:03:05,080 --> 00:03:05,720
Crying,

58
00:03:06,280 --> 00:03:07,210
crying, crying.

59
00:03:07,760 --> 00:03:09,820
That's all you do. You're so useless.

60
00:03:10,520 --> 00:03:11,920
I work myself to death all day,

61
00:03:11,920 --> 00:03:13,320
and you can't help at all.

62
00:03:13,320 --> 00:03:15,850
Can't you handle
this little thing yourself?

63
00:03:23,280 --> 00:03:24,000
Haohao,

64
00:03:24,680 --> 00:03:25,440
listen to me.

65
00:03:25,920 --> 00:03:26,079
If

66
00:03:26,240 --> 00:03:27,440
they bully you again,

67
00:03:27,520 --> 00:03:28,380
you fight back.

68
00:03:28,760 --> 00:03:29,960
Beat them until they're scared,

69
00:03:29,960 --> 00:03:31,020
until they submit,

70
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,720
until they

71
00:03:31,720 --> 00:03:33,200
never bully you again.

72
00:03:33,720 --> 00:03:34,280
Got it?

73
00:03:36,200 --> 00:03:37,400
No one cares about us,

74
00:03:38,760 --> 00:03:40,560
so we have to protect ourselves.

75
00:03:42,320 --> 00:03:43,850
I know I'm not a good sister.

76
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:47,079
I always used

77
00:03:47,079 --> 00:03:48,400
a rough way

78
00:03:49,480 --> 00:03:50,340
to educate him.

79
00:03:52,360 --> 00:03:53,400
I just hoped

80
00:03:55,520 --> 00:03:55,880
he

81
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:57,240
could mature earlier

82
00:03:59,120 --> 00:04:00,800
and face all this properly.

83
00:04:01,680 --> 00:04:03,140
Have you ever thought that

84
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,680
if he fights the world

85
00:04:05,040 --> 00:04:06,240
with violence and indifference

86
00:04:06,240 --> 00:04:07,360
like you,

87
00:04:08,680 --> 00:04:10,440
will he be happy?

88
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:13,340
I hope he's happier in the other world

89
00:04:14,200 --> 00:04:15,480
than here.

90
00:04:16,959 --> 00:04:17,760
Without you,

91
00:04:17,760 --> 00:04:19,220
there would be no Ling Hao.

92
00:04:20,760 --> 00:04:21,200
I believe that

93
00:04:21,200 --> 00:04:22,400
at least in his eyes,

94
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:24,050
you are a good sister

95
00:04:24,680 --> 00:04:25,400
and the person

96
00:04:25,400 --> 00:04:27,640
who cares about him
the most in this world.

97
00:04:27,640 --> 00:04:28,480
This world

98
00:04:29,640 --> 00:04:31,500
won't always be full of kindness.

99
00:04:32,240 --> 00:04:34,720
But there will always be
kind people to accept you.

100
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:37,650
Confrontation is not
the only way to solve problems.

101
00:04:37,680 --> 00:04:39,740
You still have a chance to start over.

102
00:04:40,159 --> 00:04:40,920
But first,

103
00:04:41,080 --> 00:04:42,920
you have to learn to accept yourself.

104
00:04:42,920 --> 00:04:43,400
I believe

105
00:04:43,400 --> 00:04:45,240
if Ling Hao were still alive,

106
00:04:45,840 --> 00:04:47,640
this is what he would want to see.

107
00:04:49,159 --> 00:04:50,080
Thank you both

108
00:04:50,880 --> 00:04:52,210
for your kindness to me.

109
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:54,880
Prosecutor Xu,

110
00:04:54,880 --> 00:04:55,810
come take a look.

111
00:04:57,680 --> 00:04:58,600
Bad influence.

112
00:04:59,280 --> 00:05:00,880
The police talked to the platform.

113
00:05:00,880 --> 00:05:01,960
The platform's feedback is that

114
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:04,000
Luan Pingping's account was reported

115
00:05:04,000 --> 00:05:05,200
because his video content

116
00:05:05,200 --> 00:05:06,600
involved bad influence.

117
00:05:06,760 --> 00:05:08,000
These are some videos
downloaded by the public

118
00:05:08,000 --> 00:05:09,360
at the time to use as evidence

119
00:05:09,360 --> 00:05:10,680
to report him.

120
00:05:11,320 --> 00:05:11,800
Play it.

121
00:05:15,480 --> 00:05:16,410
Perfect timing.

122
00:05:16,520 --> 00:05:18,520
Let's watch Luan Pingping's video
together.

123
00:05:18,520 --> 00:05:18,880
Okay.

124
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:24,690
Are there any more clothes?

125
00:05:25,600 --> 00:05:26,260
Take it off.

126
00:05:26,400 --> 00:05:27,120
Hurry up and put it on yourself.

127
00:05:27,120 --> 00:05:27,960
Stop spacing out.

128
00:05:27,960 --> 00:05:28,600
Luan Pingping

129
00:05:28,600 --> 00:05:30,200
is obviously exhausted.

130
00:05:30,400 --> 00:05:32,159
Shen Shuyue is really something
as a mother.

131
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:34,560
She keeps rushing him
without feeling bad for the kid at all.

132
00:05:34,560 --> 00:05:36,400
I've looked into this market before.

133
00:05:36,400 --> 00:05:39,530
Many child models can make
five or even six figures a day.

134
00:05:39,880 --> 00:05:40,520
Shen Shuyue,

135
00:05:40,520 --> 00:05:43,120
they've made quite a lot of money
off the child.

136
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:44,280
They also bought a 1.8 million yuan house

137
00:05:44,280 --> 00:05:46,120
in their hometown before.

138
00:05:46,680 --> 00:05:47,240
Later on,

139
00:05:47,240 --> 00:05:48,000
the house was sold.

140
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,000
In 2021,

141
00:05:49,000 --> 00:05:49,840
Luan Pingping's contract was terminated

142
00:05:49,840 --> 00:05:51,320
by the child modeling agency.

143
00:05:51,320 --> 00:05:52,000
Shortly after,

144
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,000
his video accounts on all platforms

145
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:54,730
were banned.

146
00:05:55,000 --> 00:05:56,680
Their family lost their source of income.

147
00:05:56,680 --> 00:05:58,120
Then why did he terminate the contract?

148
00:05:58,120 --> 00:05:58,960
Luan Pingping

149
00:05:58,960 --> 00:06:00,090
had acne at the time,

150
00:06:00,320 --> 00:06:02,400
and his Adam's apple started to develop.

151
00:06:02,400 --> 00:06:03,680
He no longer met the agency's

152
00:06:03,680 --> 00:06:05,280
image requirements for him.

153
00:06:05,520 --> 00:06:06,520
But it's strange.

154
00:06:07,320 --> 00:06:08,240
How could such a young child

155
00:06:08,240 --> 00:06:09,440
grow an Adam's apple?

156
00:06:10,200 --> 00:06:10,440
Exactly.

157
00:06:10,440 --> 00:06:12,040
Since he developed early,

158
00:06:12,400 --> 00:06:13,860
why didn't he grow taller?

159
00:06:14,080 --> 00:06:16,200
The detailed autopsy report isn't out yet.

160
00:06:16,200 --> 00:06:17,920
We can only tentatively assume

161
00:06:17,920 --> 00:06:19,760
it's Luan Pingping's physical condition.

162
00:06:19,760 --> 00:06:22,360
Are there any medical records
regarding this?

163
00:06:22,920 --> 00:06:23,320
Also,

164
00:06:23,320 --> 00:06:24,580
the police shared that

165
00:06:24,600 --> 00:06:26,160
during Luan Pingping's time
as a child model,

166
00:06:26,160 --> 00:06:27,120
his agency

167
00:06:27,360 --> 00:06:28,620
bought him insurance.

168
00:06:28,680 --> 00:06:30,000
With the termination of the contract,

169
00:06:30,000 --> 00:06:32,520
the original agency
didn't renew the insurance.

170
00:06:32,520 --> 00:06:33,050
However,

171
00:06:33,200 --> 00:06:34,760
the original beneficiary, Shen Shuyue,

172
00:06:34,760 --> 00:06:36,220
renewed it in her own name.

173
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,130
What are you doing here?

174
00:06:47,000 --> 00:06:49,320
The child passed away in my car after all.

175
00:06:49,600 --> 00:06:50,520
No matter what,

176
00:06:50,520 --> 00:06:51,800
I bear some responsibility.

177
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,260
I feel really bad about it.

178
00:06:54,159 --> 00:06:55,480
If you're willing,

179
00:06:56,320 --> 00:06:57,980
please take this card for now.

180
00:06:58,560 --> 00:06:59,820
But I have a condition.

181
00:07:00,160 --> 00:07:01,880
Can I take a video?

182
00:07:02,160 --> 00:07:02,760
Whatever.

183
00:07:03,560 --> 00:07:04,620
How much is in here?

184
00:07:07,360 --> 00:07:08,090
I am Ling Wei.

185
00:07:08,400 --> 00:07:10,800
Luan Pingping accidentally died in my car.

186
00:07:11,400 --> 00:07:13,400
Although I'm not criminally liable,

187
00:07:13,400 --> 00:07:14,040
I feel

188
00:07:14,800 --> 00:07:16,160
guilty.

189
00:07:17,120 --> 00:07:19,980
This is my compensation
to Luan Pingping's mother.

190
00:07:20,240 --> 00:07:21,300
Alright, alright.

191
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:22,620
How much is it exactly?

192
00:07:23,320 --> 00:07:24,400
330,000.

193
00:07:25,520 --> 00:07:26,760
330,000?

194
00:07:26,960 --> 00:07:28,020
Are you kidding me?

195
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:30,720
My son died in your car.

196
00:07:31,600 --> 00:07:32,080
Hurry up

197
00:07:32,080 --> 00:07:33,340
and take out the money.

198
00:07:33,880 --> 00:07:34,880
I'm really sorry.

199
00:07:37,000 --> 00:07:39,240
This is already all my savings.

200
00:07:41,000 --> 00:07:42,400
The prosecutor might let you off,

201
00:07:42,400 --> 00:07:43,400
but I won't.

202
00:07:43,920 --> 00:07:45,120
No matter what you do,

203
00:07:45,520 --> 00:07:46,320
800,000,

204
00:07:46,320 --> 00:07:47,250
not a penny less.

205
00:07:47,920 --> 00:07:48,580
Otherwise,

206
00:07:48,880 --> 00:07:50,080
I'll sue you to death.

207
00:07:51,280 --> 00:07:52,720
Your fever is almost 40 degrees,

208
00:07:52,720 --> 00:07:54,250
and you didn't even tell me.

209
00:07:54,960 --> 00:07:56,690
I'll message the school later.

210
00:07:56,920 --> 00:07:57,920
Don't go to school

211
00:07:57,920 --> 00:07:58,800
tomorrow.

212
00:07:58,800 --> 00:08:00,400
Stay home and get some sleep.

213
00:08:00,400 --> 00:08:02,720
I'll be fine after taking
some fever medicine.

214
00:08:02,720 --> 00:08:04,360
You're always so busy with work.

215
00:08:04,360 --> 00:08:06,020
I didn't want to distract you.

216
00:08:06,120 --> 00:08:06,960
Did you tell Chengcheng

217
00:08:06,960 --> 00:08:07,960
that you're sick?

218
00:08:09,320 --> 00:08:10,580
I haven't told him yet.

219
00:08:10,680 --> 00:08:11,560
He's old enough.

220
00:08:11,560 --> 00:08:13,020
You can't hide it from him.

221
00:08:13,120 --> 00:08:13,720
I know.

222
00:08:14,720 --> 00:08:15,980
But he's in ninth grade

223
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:18,280
and taking the high school
entrance exam this year.

224
00:08:18,280 --> 00:08:19,560
I don't want to distract him.

225
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:20,120
I think

226
00:08:20,120 --> 00:08:21,320
he'd be really sad

227
00:08:21,320 --> 00:08:22,720
if he found out on his own.

228
00:08:22,880 --> 00:08:24,000
I suggest you think it over

229
00:08:24,000 --> 00:08:25,600
and come clean with him soon.

230
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:27,490
Chengcheng,

231
00:08:28,480 --> 00:08:29,120
Mom.

232
00:08:31,400 --> 00:08:32,320
If...

233
00:08:32,559 --> 00:08:33,240
if you knew

234
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:36,400
I was hiding something from you,

235
00:08:36,720 --> 00:08:37,650
would you be mad?

236
00:08:38,520 --> 00:08:39,380
That depends on

237
00:08:39,760 --> 00:08:40,360
what it is.

238
00:08:41,799 --> 00:08:42,860
If it's about work,

239
00:08:44,360 --> 00:08:46,020
I definitely wouldn't be mad.

240
00:08:46,200 --> 00:08:46,760
But

241
00:08:47,120 --> 00:08:48,520
if it's about our family,

242
00:08:49,200 --> 00:08:49,880
I hope

243
00:08:51,240 --> 00:08:52,840
you wouldn't hide it from me.

244
00:08:53,800 --> 00:08:55,000
I'm grown up now.

245
00:08:55,320 --> 00:08:56,320
I can protect you.

246
00:08:57,560 --> 00:08:59,600
I want to do my part for our family too.

247
00:08:59,600 --> 00:09:00,600
You protect me?

248
00:09:01,480 --> 00:09:03,000
You're still a kid yourself.

249
00:09:03,000 --> 00:09:04,920
Mom should be the one protecting you.

250
00:09:04,920 --> 00:09:05,960
I'm grown up now.

251
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:07,520
I can protect you.

252
00:09:08,200 --> 00:09:09,660
Besides, there are things

253
00:09:09,760 --> 00:09:12,640
you just think I don't know.

254
00:09:15,000 --> 00:09:15,560
Okay,

255
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:16,760
you know everything.

256
00:09:17,520 --> 00:09:18,760
If you really want to protect me,

257
00:09:18,760 --> 00:09:19,820
then get well soon,

258
00:09:19,840 --> 00:09:20,520
okay?

259
00:09:23,000 --> 00:09:23,600
Close your eyes.

260
00:09:23,600 --> 00:09:24,460
Get some sleep.

261
00:10:06,000 --> 00:10:06,600
Wei,

262
00:10:06,840 --> 00:10:09,100
try this yogurt bowl and see if it's good.

263
00:10:10,760 --> 00:10:11,600
How bad

264
00:10:12,120 --> 00:10:13,320
could it possibly be?

265
00:10:14,040 --> 00:10:14,700
Just try it.

266
00:10:21,040 --> 00:10:21,570
How is it?

267
00:10:29,200 --> 00:10:30,200
It's really good.

268
00:10:36,760 --> 00:10:37,320
Wei,

269
00:10:37,960 --> 00:10:38,640
I feel like

270
00:10:40,240 --> 00:10:41,000
Ling Wei

271
00:10:41,800 --> 00:10:44,520
is always so overbearing.

272
00:10:45,040 --> 00:10:45,760
I guess it's a way

273
00:10:45,760 --> 00:10:47,200
to protect herself.

274
00:10:47,840 --> 00:10:48,880
After all, so many people

275
00:10:48,880 --> 00:10:50,480
are prejudiced against her.

276
00:10:50,640 --> 00:10:51,800
Acting like that

277
00:10:51,800 --> 00:10:52,440
is her

278
00:10:53,240 --> 00:10:55,240
subconscious way of arming herself.

279
00:10:55,240 --> 00:10:56,370
Why are you suddenly

280
00:10:56,480 --> 00:10:57,880
speaking up for Ling Wei?

281
00:10:58,600 --> 00:10:59,880
Not exactly.

282
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:01,320
I just think,

283
00:11:01,680 --> 00:11:03,040
in a way,

284
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:05,040
she's quite pitiful.

285
00:11:08,920 --> 00:11:09,440
Wei,

286
00:11:10,280 --> 00:11:11,080
I think you're

287
00:11:11,120 --> 00:11:12,400
really amazing.

288
00:11:12,800 --> 00:11:14,160
And every time you handle a case,

289
00:11:14,160 --> 00:11:15,640
you're so meticulous.

290
00:11:15,960 --> 00:11:18,000
You're incredibly cool.

291
00:11:18,760 --> 00:11:19,680
Every time I see you working,

292
00:11:19,680 --> 00:11:21,210
I feel like you're glowing.

293
00:11:21,680 --> 00:11:22,600
So cool.

294
00:11:23,160 --> 00:11:24,240
Stop, stop, stop.

295
